WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.612
This dossier examines documented foreign interference in Canadian democracy.

00:00:05.562 --> 00:00:09.650
CSIS warned every Prime Minister since 2004.

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:13.700
Beijing operated police stations on Canadian soil.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:16.762
Diaspora communities were intimidated.

00:00:16.762 --> 00:00:19.462
The Hogue Commission confirmed it all.
